#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:1
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "模拟"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:3
msgid "Bootstrap, Monte Carlo and stress scenarios with seeded reproducibility."
msgstr "带随机种子可复现性的自助法、蒙特卡洛与压力情景。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../guides/portfolio-risk.md) for task-oriented "
"examples. Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same"
" commit as the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的示例参见[使用指南](../guides/portfolio-risk.md)。以下签名由与本站点其余内容同一提交的公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Owning simulation result with paths, terminal statistics and risk measures."
msgstr "持有路径、终值统计与风险度量的模拟结果对象。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid ""
"Instances are created by analyze_simulation_paths; the constructor that "
"accepts ready-made state is private. Copy and move operations copy or "
"transfer the owned path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "实例由 analyze_simulation_paths 创建；接受现成状态的构造函数为私有。拷贝与移动操作会复制或转移所持有的路径帧、统计量与终值分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "公共函数"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Copies the path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "复制路径帧、统计量与终值分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Moves the path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "移动路径帧、统计量与终值分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Assigns by copying the path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "通过复制路径帧、统计量与终值分布进行赋值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Assigns by moving the path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "通过移动路径帧、统计量与终值分布进行赋值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Destroys the owned path frame, statistics and terminal distribution."
msgstr "销毁所持有的路径帧、统计量与终值分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Returns the owned path frame."
msgstr "返回所持有的路径帧。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Returns the cached terminal statistics."
msgstr "返回缓存的终值统计。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Returns the number of simulated paths."
msgstr "返回模拟路径数量。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Returns the number of observations per path."
msgstr "返回每条路径的观测数量。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Computes the terminal value at risk at alpha."
msgstr "计算置信水平 alpha 下的终值 VaR。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid ""
"The result is the linearly interpolated alpha percentile of the terminal "
"values."
msgstr "结果为终值序列线性插值后的 alpha 分位数。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid "Computes the terminal conditional value at risk at alpha."
msgstr "计算置信水平 alpha 下的终值条件 VaR。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:7
msgid ""
"The result is the arithmetic mean of the terminal values at or below the "
"corresponding value at risk."
msgstr "结果为不高于对应 VaR 的终值的算术平均。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md
msgid "Throws"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:10
msgid "Lower and upper bounds of a percentile bootstrap interval."
msgstr "分位数自助法区间的上下界。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:10 ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:16 ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
