#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:10
msgid "Lower percentile bound."
msgstr "下界分位数值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:10
msgid "Upper percentile bound."
msgstr "上界分位数值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
msgid "Bootstrap summaries for the mean, deviation and ratio statistics."
msgstr "均值、标准差与比率统计量的自助法摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
msgid "Summary of the mean statistic."
msgstr "均值统计量的摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
msgid "Summary of the sample deviation statistic."
msgstr "样本标准差统计量的摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
msgid "Summary of the Sharpe-like ratio."
msgstr "类夏普比率的摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:13
msgid "Summary of the Sortino-like ratio."
msgstr "类索提诺比率的摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:16
msgid "Summary of one bootstrapped statistic."
msgstr "单个自助法统计量的摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:16
msgid "Statistic observed on the NaN-cleaned input sample."
msgstr "在剔除 NaN 的输入样本上观测到的统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:16
msgid "Sample deviation of the bootstrap draws."
msgstr "自助法抽样的样本标准差。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:16
msgid "Percentile interval of the bootstrap draws."
msgstr "自助法抽样的分位数区间。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
msgid "User-defined stress transformation."
msgstr "用户自定义的压力变换。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
msgid ""
"Each stressed return is (return + return_shift) * return_multiplier. Names "
"must be non-empty, distinct and must not reuse a predefined name."
msgstr ""
"每个受压收益率按 (return + return_shift) * return_multiplier "
"计算。名称必须非空、互不相同，且不得复用预定义名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
msgid "Scenario name shown in results."
msgstr "结果中显示的情景名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
msgid "Additive shift applied first."
msgstr "先应用的加性平移。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:19
msgid "Multiplier applied after the shift."
msgstr "平移之后应用的乘数。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:22
msgid "Annualized drift and volatility estimated from periodic returns."
msgstr "由周期性收益率估计的年化漂移与波动率。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:22
msgid "Annualized arithmetic mean return."
msgstr "年化算术平均收益。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:22
msgid "Annualized sample standard deviation."
msgstr "年化样本标准差。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "Terminal-value percentiles using linear interpolation."
msgstr "采用线性插值的终值分位数。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "1st percentile."
msgstr "第 1 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "5th percentile."
msgstr "第 5 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "25th percentile."
msgstr "第 25 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "50th percentile (the median)."
msgstr "第 50 百分位（中位数）。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "75th percentile."
msgstr "第 75 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "95th percentile."
msgstr "第 95 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:25
msgid "99th percentile."
msgstr "第 99 百分位。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:28
msgid "Summary statistics of the terminal path values."
msgstr "终值路径的汇总统计。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:28
msgid "Arithmetic mean of terminal values."
msgstr "终值的算术平均。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:28
msgid "Sample deviation (n - 1); NaN for one path."
msgstr "样本标准差（n - 1）；仅一条路径时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:28
msgid "Median terminal value."
msgstr "终值中位数。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:28
msgid "Terminal-value percentiles."
msgstr "终值分位数。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Outcome of one stress scenario."
msgstr "单个压力情景的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Scenario name."
msgstr "情景名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Stressed returns on the input index and column."
msgstr "在输入索引与列上的受压收益率。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Compounded stressed return."
msgstr "复利累积的受压收益。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Deepest drawdown as a negative fraction."
msgstr "最大回撤，以负小数表示。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "Annualized volatility of the stressed returns."
msgstr "受压收益率的年化波动率。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:31
msgid "1 + cumulative_return."
msgstr "1 + cumulative_return。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Statistic computed for each bootstrap resample."
msgstr "对每次自助法重抽样计算的统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34 ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Arithmetic mean of the drawn sample."
msgstr "抽样样本的算术平均。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Sample deviation (n - 1); NaN for one value."
msgstr "样本标准差（n - 1）；仅一个值时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Median, averaging the two middle values."
msgstr "中位数，取中间两个值的平均。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Mean / sample deviation, scaled by sqrt(252)."
msgstr "均值 / 样本标准差，并按 sqrt(252) 缩放。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Mean / downside deviation, scaled by sqrt(252)."
msgstr "均值 / 下行偏差，并按 sqrt(252) 缩放。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Smallest drawn value."
msgstr "最小的抽样值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:34
msgid "Largest drawn value."
msgstr "最大的抽样值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Predefined stress transformations."
msgstr "预定义的压力变换。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Sets the middle return to -0.20 (crash)."
msgstr "将中间的收益率设为 -0.20（崩盘）。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Sets the middle return to 0.10 (spike)."
msgstr "将中间的收益率设为 0.10（飙升）。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Halves every return (vol_crush)."
msgstr "将每个收益率减半（vol_crush）。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:37
msgid "Doubles every return (vol_spike)."
msgstr "将每个收益率加倍（vol_spike）。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:40
msgid "Analyzes a path frame into a simulation result."
msgstr "将路径帧分析为模拟结果。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:40
msgid ""
"The frame must have a non-empty index and only double columns, with each "
"column matching the index length. Each column's last value is its terminal "
"value and must be finite. The result owns a copy of the paths plus the "
"terminal statistics and distribution."
msgstr "该帧必须具有非空索引且只包含 double 列，每列长度必须与索引一致。每列的最后一个值即其终值，且必须为有限值。结果持有路径的副本以及终值统计与分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:43
msgid "Annualizes a volatility-like value with the source's period factors."
msgstr "使用源实现的周期因子对类波动率值做年化。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:43
msgid ""
"Recognized periods are case-insensitive daily (252), weekly (52), monthly "
"(12) and yearly (1); any other value uses the daily factor. The result is "
"value * sqrt(factor)."
msgstr ""
"可识别的周期不区分大小写，包括 daily (252)、weekly (52)、monthly (12) 与 yearly "
"(1)；其他取值使用日度因子。结果为 value * sqrt(factor)。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:46
msgid "Appends antithetic mirror paths to a path frame."
msgstr "向路径帧追加对偶镜像路径。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:46
msgid ""
"Every double column is retained, and a companion column named "
"antithetic_<name> is added with values 2 * c - x, where c is the first value"
" of the first double column. The input index and column order are preserved,"
" and mirror columns follow the source columns."
msgstr ""
"保留所有 double 列，并新增名为 antithetic_<name> 的伴随列，其值为 2 * c - x，其中 c 为第一个 double "
"列的首个值。输入的索引与列顺序保持不变，镜像列紧随源列之后。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:49
msgid "Computes a percentile bootstrap confidence interval."
msgstr "计算分位数自助法置信区间。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:49
msgid ""
"The interval spans the alpha / 2 and 1 - alpha / 2 linearly interpolated "
"percentiles of the generated statistic distribution. Validation of alpha "
"happens before any resampling."
msgstr "区间取生成的统计量分布中 alpha / 2 与 1 - alpha / 2 的线性插值分位数。对 alpha 的校验在任何重抽样之前完成。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:52
msgid "Generates a bootstrap distribution of one statistic."
msgstr "生成单个统计量的自助法分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:52
msgid ""
"NaN returns are removed before resampling and infinities are rejected. Each "
"of the resample_count draws samples the retained population with replacement"
" at its original size. A supplied seed makes the native 64-bit Mersenne "
"Twister stream repeatable; omitting it seeds from std::random_device. Native"
" draws are not guaranteed to match any other RNG implementation."
msgstr ""
"重抽样前会剔除 NaN 收益率并拒绝无穷值。resample_count 次抽样中的每一次都以原有规模对保留的总体进行有放回抽样。提供随机种子可使原生 "
"64 位梅森旋转序列可复现；省略时由 std::random_device 播种。不保证原生抽样与其他随机数实现一致。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:55
msgid "Generates a bootstrap distribution from explicit draw indices."
msgstr "由显式抽样索引生成自助法分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:55
msgid ""
"Draws address the NaN-cleaned positional input population. Every draw must "
"contain exactly that population's size and only in-range indices. No random "
"engine is used. Empty draw_indices yields an empty distribution after the "
"input and statistic are validated."
msgstr ""
"抽样索引指向剔除 NaN 后按位置排列的输入总体。每次抽样必须恰好包含该总体的规模，且只能使用范围内索引。不使用随机引擎。在输入与统计量校验通过后，空的"
" draw_indices 产生空分布。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:58
msgid "Computes bootstrap summaries for four statistics."
msgstr "计算四个统计量的自助法摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:58
msgid ""
"Each statistic is summarized in a separate native run with the supplied seed"
" and reports its observed value, the sample deviation of its draws, and the "
"percentile interval at alpha / 2 and 1 - alpha / 2. Validation of alpha and "
"the resample count happens before input access."
msgstr ""
"每个统计量都在一次独立的原生运行中按给定种子汇总，报告其观测值、抽样的样本标准差，以及 alpha / 2 与 1 - alpha / 2 "
"处的分位数区间。对 alpha 与重抽样次数的校验发生在访问输入之前。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:61
msgid "Estimates annualized drift and volatility from a return column."
msgstr "由收益率列估计年化漂移与波动率。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:61
msgid ""
"NaN values are dropped and infinities are rejected; at least two retained "
"returns are required. Drift is the retained mean multiplied by "
"periods_per_year; volatility is the sample standard deviation (n - 1) "
"multiplied by sqrt(periods_per_year). Timestamp order is not used."
msgstr ""
"剔除 NaN 并拒绝无穷值；至少需要保留两个收益率。漂移为保留样本的均值乘以 periods_per_year；波动率为样本标准差（n - 1）乘以 "
"sqrt(periods_per_year)。不利用时间戳顺序。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:64
msgid "Simulates cumulative-return paths calibrated from historical returns."
msgstr "基于历史收益率标定的参数模拟累积收益率路径。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:64
msgid ""
"Annualized drift and volatility are estimated from the selected return "
"column (NaN values dropped), prices are simulated from 1.0 over horizon "
"periods at periods_per_year, the initial price row is removed, and each path"
" stores price_t - 1. Columns are named path_<n>."
msgstr ""
"由所选收益率列（剔除 NaN）估计年化漂移与波动率，从 1.0 起按 periods_per_year 模拟 horizon "
"个周期的价格，删除初始价格行，每条路径存储 price_t - 1。列名为 path_<n>。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:67
msgid "Builds a square correlation breakdown matrix."
msgstr "构建方阵式相关性瓦解矩阵。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:67
msgid ""
"The matrix has one row and one double column per asset, in the supplied "
"order, with an ordinal index. Diagonal entries are 1.0 and every off-"
"diagonal entry is target_correlation, which is retained even when it lies "
"outside [-1, 1]. Empty asset_names yields an empty frame."
msgstr ""
"矩阵按给定顺序为每个资产生成一行一列 double 列，索引为序号。对角元素为 1.0，所有非对角元素为 "
"target_correlation，即使其落在 [-1, 1] 之外也照原样保留。asset_names 为空时产生空帧。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:70
msgid "Simulates geometric Brownian motion price paths."
msgstr "模拟几何布朗运动价格路径。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:70
msgid ""
"Each path starts at initial_value and evolves for trunc(total_years / "
"time_step) steps using S[k + 1] = S[k] * exp((drift - volatility^2 / 2) * "
"time_step + volatility * sqrt(time_step) * Z) with standard normal draws Z. "
"The output index is ordinal and paths are named path_<n>; the first row is "
"the initial value."
msgstr ""
"每条路径从 initial_value 开始，演化 trunc(total_years / time_step) 步，递推式为 S[k + 1] = "
"S[k] * exp((drift - volatility^2 / 2) * time_step + volatility * "
"sqrt(time_step) * Z)，其中 Z 为标准正态抽样。输出索引为序号，路径命名为 path_<n>；第一行为初始值。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:73
msgid "Samples a Latin hypercube design."
msgstr "采样拉丁超立方设计。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:73
msgid ""
"Every output column is a permutation of sample_count equal-probability "
"strata in [0, 1), with one uniformly distributed point per stratum. The "
"index is ordinal and columns are named lhs_dimension_<n>. Zero counts "
"produce the corresponding empty shape. A supplied seed makes the native "
"64-bit Mersenne Twister stream repeatable; omitted seeds are not "
"reproducible and native draws make no cross-implementation RNG claim."
msgstr ""
"每个输出列都是 [0, 1) 内 sample_count 个等概率分层的某种排列，每个分层取一个均匀分布的点。索引为序号，列名为 "
"lhs_dimension_<n>。计数为 0 时产生相应的空形状。提供随机种子可使原生 64 "
"位梅森旋转序列可复现；省略种子时不可复现，且原生抽样不做跨实现随机数一致性的声明。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:76
msgid "Builds a tabular summary of stress scenario results."
msgstr "构建压力情景结果的表格摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:76
msgid ""
"The table has an ordinal index and one row per result, with the columns "
"scenario, cumulative_return, max_drawdown, volatility and final_value. Empty"
" input yields a typed empty table."
msgstr ""
"表格索引为序号，每个结果一行，列为 scenario、cumulative_return、max_drawdown、volatility 和 "
"final_value。输入为空时产生带类型的空表。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:79
msgid "Simulates a calibrated Monte Carlo path set from historical returns."
msgstr "基于历史收益率模拟标定参数的蒙特卡洛路径集。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:79
msgid ""
"Annualized drift and volatility are estimated from the selected return "
"column (NaN values dropped), geometric Brownian motion is simulated from 1.0"
" for horizon steps at 252 periods per year, and the resulting price paths "
"are converted to cumulative returns. When antithetic is true, "
"antithetic_variates is applied to those paths, so the stored path count is "
"doubled."
msgstr ""
"由所选收益率列（剔除 NaN）估计年化漂移与波动率，从 1.0 起按每年 252 个周期模拟 horizon "
"步几何布朗运动，并将得到的价格路径转换为累积收益率。当 antithetic 为 true 时对这些路径应用 "
"antithetic_variates，因此存储的路径数会翻倍。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:82
msgid "Simulates price paths directly from annualized parameters."
msgstr "直接由年化参数模拟价格路径。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:82
msgid ""
"Annualized drift and volatility are converted to per-step values (drift / "
"252 and volatility / sqrt(252)), and horizon periods are simulated with a 1 "
"/ 252 year step. The returned paths start at initial_value and include the "
"initial row."
msgstr ""
"将年化漂移与波动率转换为单步值（drift / 252 与 volatility / sqrt(252)），以 1 / 252 年步长模拟 "
"horizon 个周期。返回的路径从 initial_value 开始并包含初始行。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:85
msgid "Runs the four predefined stress scenarios in source order."
msgstr "按源实现顺序运行四个预定义压力情景。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:85
msgid "Applies crash, spike, vol_crush and vol_spike in that order."
msgstr "依次应用 crash、spike、vol_crush 与 vol_spike。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:88
msgid "Runs selected predefined and custom stress scenarios."
msgstr "运行选定的预定义与自定义压力情景。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:88
msgid ""
"Predefined results appear first in caller order, followed by custom results "
"in caller order. NaN returns are rejected, while infinite returns are "
"retained."
msgstr "预定义结果先按调用方顺序出现，随后是调用方顺序的自定义结果。拒绝 NaN 收益率，但保留无穷收益率。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:91
msgid "Validates and copies a return series."
msgstr "校验并复制收益率序列。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:91
msgid ""
"The source rejects empty input and NaN values; the native contract also "
"rejects infinities so every returned value is finite. Contract failures "
"raise fincore_error with a structured validation category/code."
msgstr "源实现拒绝空输入与 NaN；原生契约还拒绝无穷值，因此返回的每个值都是有限的。契约校验失败会抛出带有结构化校验类别/代码的 fincore_error。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:94
msgid "Validates and copies the named return column of a frame."
msgstr "校验并复制帧中指定名称的收益率列。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:97
msgid "Prefix of generated antithetic mirror columns."
msgstr "生成的对偶镜像列的前缀。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:100
msgid "Name of the generated bootstrap statistic column."
msgstr "生成的自助法统计量列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:103
msgid "Prefix of generated geometric-Brownian-motion path columns."
msgstr "生成的几何布朗运动路径列的前缀。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:106
msgid "Prefix of Latin-hypercube dimension columns."
msgstr "拉丁超立方维度列的前缀。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:109
msgid "Name of the cumulative-return column in a scenario table."
msgstr "情景表中累积收益率列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:112
msgid "Name of the final-value column in a scenario table."
msgstr "情景表中终值列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:115
msgid "Name of the maximum-drawdown column in a scenario table."
msgstr "情景表中最大回撤列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:118
msgid "Name of the scenario-name column in a scenario table."
msgstr "情景表中情景名称列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/simulation.md:121
msgid "Name of the volatility column in a scenario table."
msgstr "情景表中波动率列的名称。"

